Subject: [PATCH 04/17] RESTRICT AUTOMERGE Filter ignorable Unicode codepoints
 in ExternalStorageProvider

Normalize directory paths by filtering out ignorable Unicode codepoints before performing block checks.

Bug: 475232460
Test: atest ExternalStorageProviderTest
Flag: EXEMPT BUGFIX
